    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of Girls and Blocks. A world of sex, lust, and debauchery!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852950/extras/cf3f34565e268c270077ed3717e376b6.poster.avif?t=1749998788\" width=300 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852950/extras/cf3f34565e268c270077ed3717e376b6.webm?t=1749998788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852950/extras/cf3f34565e268c270077ed3717e376b6.mp4?t=1749998788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852950/extras/33bd54a90d38f1e2ce665231fe427101.poster.avif?t=1749998788\" width=300 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852950/extras/33bd54a90d38f1e2ce665231fe427101.webm?t=1749998788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852950/extras/33bd54a90d38f1e2ce665231fe427101.mp4?t=1749998788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you think this is just Tetris or a block game? Oh, you're wrong! It\u2019s a story about a guy who finds himself on an enchanting island where many charming girls await him! By a happy coincidence, he comes across a magical box with a game that helps him gain access to any of the girls. And most importantly, this is just the beginning! The box has a will of its own and contains... well, you\u2019ll find out for yourself if you dare! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 20 different locations, each where the main character can meet a unique girl, invite her on a date, use the magical box to release all her hidden desires, and eventually have sex with her. This game is just what you need for a relaxing evening to escape the everyday hustle. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story in the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angels, demons, wish fulfillment, beautiful girls, and... a block game. What could they have in common? Uncover all the secrets of Paradise Island and fulfill all your deepest desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852950/extras/8ef06c1a084076495b85cac15a27bd8c.avif?t=1749998788\" width=600 height=328 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy classic Tetris mechanics that have been loved by millions of players worldwide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Admire cute and charming girls who are ready to strip entirely to solve the puzzle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the girls, after which you will have the chance to have sex with each one!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use boosters to make level progression easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the vivid graphics and delightful music that enhance the gameplay and make it even more fun. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique game world with a detailed map of the island, where everyone can find their own paradise. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852950/extras/8b98953e5e5c8d6581644ac0896b9928.avif?t=1749998788\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Girls and Blocks right now and see how far you can progress in this unique hybrid game of puzzles and entertainment!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of Girls and Blocks. A world of sex, lust, and debauchery!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852950/extras/cf3f34565e268c270077ed3717e376b6.poster.avif?t=1749998788\" width=300 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852950/extras/cf3f34565e268c270077ed3717e376b6.webm?t=1749998788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852950/extras/cf3f34565e268c270077ed3717e376b6.mp4?t=1749998788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852950/extras/33bd54a90d38f1e2ce665231fe427101.poster.avif?t=1749998788\" width=300 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852950/extras/33bd54a90d38f1e2ce665231fe427101.webm?t=1749998788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852950/extras/33bd54a90d38f1e2ce665231fe427101.mp4?t=1749998788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you think this is just Tetris or a block game? Oh, you're wrong! It\u2019s a story about a guy who finds himself on an enchanting island where many charming girls await him! By a happy coincidence, he comes across a magical box with a game that helps him gain access to any of the girls. And most importantly, this is just the beginning! The box has a will of its own and contains... well, you\u2019ll find out for yourself if you dare! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 20 different locations, each where the main character can meet a unique girl, invite her on a date, use the magical box to release all her hidden desires, and eventually have sex with her. This game is just what you need for a relaxing evening to escape the everyday hustle. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story in the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angels, demons, wish fulfillment, beautiful girls, and... a block game. What could they have in common? Uncover all the secrets of Paradise Island and fulfill all your deepest desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852950/extras/8ef06c1a084076495b85cac15a27bd8c.avif?t=1749998788\" width=600 height=328 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy classic Tetris mechanics that have been loved by millions of players worldwide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Admire cute and charming girls who are ready to strip entirely to solve the puzzle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the girls, after which you will have the chance to have sex with each one!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use boosters to make level progression easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the vivid graphics and delightful music that enhance the gameplay and make it even more fun. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique game world with a detailed map of the island, where everyone can find their own paradise. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852950/extras/8b98953e5e5c8d6581644ac0896b9928.avif?t=1749998788\" width=600 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Girls and Blocks right now and see how far you can progress in this unique hybrid game of puzzles and entertainment!</p></li></ul>",
